        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: A Troll in Central Park; All Dogs Go to Heaven\n- People: Don Bluth; Gary Goldman\n- Companies: United Artists; Goldcrest Films\n- Topics: animated films; musical fantasy-comedy; comedy-drama\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, All Dogs Go to Heaven was released as an animated musical comedy-drama film.\n- Don Bluth directed and produced All Dogs Go to Heaven.\n- United Artists and Goldcrest Films released All Dogs Go to Heaven.\n- In 1994, A Troll in Central Park was released in some countries as Stanley's Magic Garden.\n- A Troll in Central Park is an American animated musical fantasy-comedy film.\n- Don Bluth and Gary Goldman directed A Troll in Central Park.\n- Don Bluth and Gary Goldman were also creators of Rock-A-Doodle, The Land Before Time, All Dogs Go to Heaven, The Secret of NIMH, and An American Tail.",
